graph TD
    A[Nutrient Limitation] --> B{Stress Type?}
    B -->|Nitrogen| C[Nitrogen Starvation Response]
    B -->|Carbon| D[Carbon Starvation Response]
    B -->|Phosphate| E[Phosphate Starvation Response]
    B -->|Amino Acids| F[Amino Acid Starvation Response]
    
    C --> G[Nitrogen Assimilation]
    G --> H[Nitrogen Recycling]
    H --> I[Nitrogen Stress Response]
    
    D --> J[Carbon Metabolism]
    J --> K[Energy Conservation]
    K --> L[Carbon Stress Response]
    
    E --> M[Phosphate Uptake]
    M --> N[Phosphate Recycling]
    N --> O[Phosphate Stress Response]
    
    F --> P[Amino Acid Synthesis]
    P --> Q[Protein Degradation]
    Q --> R[Amino Acid Stress Response]
    
    I --> S[Nutrient Stress Response Complete]
    L --> S
    O --> S
    R --> S
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> T[TORC1 Inhibition]
    T --> U[Autophagy Activation]
    U --> V[Nutrient Recycling]
    V --> S
    
    %% Regulation
    S --> W[Stress Status]
    W --> X{Nutrients Available?}
    X -->|Yes| Y[Response Termination]
    X -->|No| Z[Response Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    AA[Nitrogen Assimilation Enzymes] --> G
    BB[Carbon Metabolism Enzymes] --> J
    CC[Phosphate Transporters] --> M
    DD[Amino Acid Synthetases] --> P
    EE[TORC1] --> T
    FF[Autophagy Factors] --> U
    
